{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a world where your deepest fears become reality and solve puzzles that challenge both courage and intellect in this thrilling VR experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0FIND YOUR WAY </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your way across precarious platforms suspended in darkness, where falling is a constant threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408640/extras/teleport-optimized.gif?t=1744042052\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0EXPLORE DIFFERENT FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Confront the fear of heights as you navigate misleading paths and uncover hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408640/extras/double-newbox-optimized.gif?t=1744042052\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0DON'T FALL DOWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful what step you take, it could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408640/extras/falling-optimized.gif?t=1744042052\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Kira and his faithful teddy bear as they find themselves high above an abyss in a dark and mysterious realm. Every step could be their last, and only by facing the vertigo-inducing heights can they hope to escape.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a minimalist puzzle world brought to life with stunning 3D visuals that amplify the sensation of towering heights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience unique melodies and soundscapes that intensify the atmosphere and draw you deeper into Kira's journey.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Are you brave enough to face your fears and help Kira find his way out?</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3408640?t=1744042052","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3408640?t=1744042052","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408640/69758e6077cfd4a14c72984aabc8febebabff5f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744042052","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408640/69758e6077cfd4a14c72984aabc8febebabff5f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744042052","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into a world where your deepest fears become reality and solve puzzles that challenge both courage and intellect in this thrilling VR experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0FIND YOUR WAY </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your way across precarious platforms suspended in darkness, where falling is a constant threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408640/extras/teleport-optimized.gif?t=1744042052\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0EXPLORE DIFFERENT FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Confront the fear of heights as you navigate misleading paths and uncover hidden secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408640/extras/double-newbox-optimized.gif?t=1744042052\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0DON'T FALL DOWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Be careful what step you take, it could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408640/extras/falling-optimized.gif?t=1744042052\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Kira and his faithful teddy bear as they find themselves high above an abyss in a dark and mysterious realm. Every step could be their last, and only by facing the vertigo-inducing heights can they hope to escape.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a minimalist puzzle world brought to life with stunning 3D visuals that amplify the sensation of towering heights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience unique melodies and soundscapes that intensify the atmosphere and draw you deeper into Kira's journey.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Are you brave enough to face your fears and help Kira find his way out?</strong></h2>","developers":["Redelsoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_imag